Thought: Now I'll perform cross-validation to get a more robust estimate of model performance using the specified number of folds (cv_folds=5)
Action: perform_cross_validation
Action Input: {"train_data_path": "/Users/n0w0f/1_ml_claude_react/ml_nitrides_trial_9/ml_data/train.csv", "target_column": "formation_energy_per_atom", "cv_folds": 5, "hyperparameters": {"n_estimators": 200, "max_depth": 8, "learning_rate": 0.1, "subsample": 0.8, "colsample_bytree": 0.8, "reg_alpha": 0.1, "reg_lambda": 0.1}}
